    "body": "I used OpenIV with RDR2 closed and exported the base and update ITEM_TEXTURES and UI_ITEMVIEWER archives. LEXEDITOR now uses 544 new local PNGs: 309 ITEM_TEXTURES records and 235 UI_ITEMVIEWER records. This is a partial repair, not a complete one: 84 unique catalog references are not present under their catalog IDs in those archives, and two resolved DDS files use a pixel format the current converter cannot decode. Those records still show the missing marker; I left this as needs a human rather than claiming the whole gap is fixed.",
